ult: The signed contract/rate sheet either confirms \"no cap, no extra fees\" (verdict holds — B cheaper by ~$12/month at 180kg) or reveals a cap/fee (recompute cost at 180kg with the new term before deciding).\n- Not in scope: Whether monthly volume might exceed 200-300kg in the future — not worth checking now since expected volume (180kg) sits comfortably below both A's 200kg cap and the 300kg breakeven.\n- Exercise: Request and review Service B's written rate sheet/contract terms directly from the provider before signing.\n- Evidence source: another person's answer (Service B's own contract/rate documentation).\n- Target: Service B (the vendor under consideration).\n- Done when: You have the written terms in hand and confirm no additional caps or fees apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8080,"cache_read_input_tokens":1230,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8080},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"db73ea7c-9706-4a61-aca9-5da7a7fb31d9","uuid":"172b06c9-c384-4dfd-b1ed-6412a6cd39a3","timestamp":"2026-09-28T13:54:10.577Z","request_id":"req_011CfVx26zaZ3Dp8WMiDwkZT"}
